        },
        {
          "text": " Kotema atiar, “Kanuka aiyuunikus naedit. Naarai abeit katemari yes atiar, arai kijaas kaiyuun naetia ecokat loka ekaradali, ilimokinete eroŋat lo ebe, ‘Konyou kane, kolot laije,’ enyouni do; kwabo emamei akirot nakikaruni yes. [",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.17.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.17.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
